	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Pack.m_UploadIcon]": "Icon for the upload's folder in the picker (the heading that groups everything from one Paradox Mods upload). Set it on one pack in the upload. With a shared heading, offers this as its icon.",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Pack.m_Parent]": "A pack this pack sits under. The parent's name heads the folder and its icon is the folder's. Ship the parent asset in every upload that uses it. Leave None to use Display name or the upload instead.",
	"Editor.FIELD[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Pack.m_DisplayName]": "Display name",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Pack.m_DisplayName]": "The heading this pack lists under in the picker, e.g. 'DB Regio BaWü Trains'. Every pack with the same display name, from any creator, shares one folder (case and spacing do not matter). On a parent pack this is the heading shown instead of the prefab name.",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Pack.m_Exclusive]": "Only for a pack used as Parent: keep its folder separate from anyone who merely types the same display name. Off, the folder merges with packs of the same display name.",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Variant.m_Placeholder]": "The pack this vehicle is a variant of. Its name heads the group and its UI Object icon is the group's picture. Optional: leave None for a vehicle that only carries countries.",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Variant.m_Index]": "Position under the pack, low first. Leave gaps (10, 20, 30) so a later variant can be slotted between existing ones.",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Variant.m_Countries]": "Where this vehicle plausibly operates, up to five. Shown as flags in the picker and filterable by players.",
	"Editor.FIELD_TOOLTIP[BetterTransitSelector.Prefabs.BTS_Variant.m_Icon]": "A picture for this vehicle's row in the picker only. Leave empty to use the asset's normal thumbnail. The rest of the game is unaffected.",

	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[Fleet]": "Fleet",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[Fleet.Tooltip]": "Vehicles on the line now, and how many the line wants for its interval and loop time. Set by the route, not by the vehicle model.",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[PerDeparture]": "Per departure",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[PerDeparture.Tooltip]": "Passengers one vehicle can carry. A range when several models are selected, since the game picks one at random for each vehicle it sends.",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[FleetCapacity]": "Fleet capacity",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[FleetCapacity.Tooltip]": "Passengers the whole fleet carries at once, at the average capacity of the selected models.",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[LoadNow]": "Load now",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[LoadNow.Tooltip]": "Passengers aboard right now against the seats on the line's current vehicles. The same figure as the transport overview's usage.",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[LoadProjected]": "Load with this mix",
	"BetterTransitSelector.UI[LoadProjected.Tooltip]": "Today's riders spread over the fleet the line wants, if every vehicle were the selected models' average. Over 80% the line is crowded: pick bigger stock or raise the vehicle count to the number shown.",
